#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "捐助"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "{% assign strings = site.data.strings.sidebars.donate %}"
msgstr "{% assign strings = site.data.strings.sidebars.donate %}"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "F-Droid is powered by your donations!"
msgstr "F-Droid 是由您的捐助推動的！"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "If you want to contribute financially, we recommend using a **free (as in free software) donation platform** like **[Liberapay](https://liberapay.com/F-Droid-Data/)** or **[Open Collective](https://opencollective.com/f-droid/)**. **Liberapay** has lower fees but **Open Collective** allows more flexibility and transparency on how the funds are used.  Both platforms allow for recurrent donations which are highly desirable for making F-Droid sustainable."
msgstr "如果您想要出錢幫助我們，建議用 **開放的 (像開放的軟體) 捐助平臺** 像是 **[Liberapay](https://liberapay.com/F-Droid-Data/)** 或 **[Open Collective](https://opencollective.com/f-droid/)**。**Liberapay** 手續費較低，而 **Open Collective** 平臺則有比較多可以調整的部分，而且金流較透明。 這兩個平臺都可以選擇固定一段時間自動再捐款，如果您能固定捐款當然是幫助 F-Droid 可持續維護的好方法。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Your donations will be used for:"
msgstr "您的捐助將會用作："

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Paying for server resources"
msgstr "支付伺服器資源"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Paying for merchandise (stickers)"
msgstr "支付周邊商品 (貼紙)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Paying contributors for administration and development work"
msgstr "支付貢獻者的行政與開發工作"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Travel sponsorship for contributors for conferences or meetups"
msgstr "貢獻者出席會議或聚會的旅行津貼"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Your donations will NOT be used for:"
msgstr "您的捐款**不會**用作："

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Financially supporting the developers of apps that are published on F-Droid. _To donate to app developers, use the donations options listed for each app._"
msgstr "財政支援在 F-Droid 上發行之應用程式的開發者。_如欲捐助應用程式開發者，請使用應用程式各自列出的捐助選項。_"

