#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issues"
msgstr "問題"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you come across an issue regarding F-Droid, please report it to the related issue tracker."
msgstr "若您遇到有關 F-Droid 的問題，請前往相關的問題追蹤系統回報。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client App"
msgstr "用戶端應用程式"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you’re having a problem with the F-Droid client application (our app store app), please check if we already know about it, and/or report it in [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."
msgstr "如果您在 F-Droid 用戶端 (即我們的應用程式商店) 應用程式中遇到問題，請在此[問題追蹤系統](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)查對是否為已知問題或回報。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App Data"
msgstr "應用程式資料"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For problems related to the contents of the F-Droid repository (the apps in our app store), such as a disappeared or outdated applications, please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."
msgstr "有關 F-Droid 軟體庫內容（即我們的應用程式商店中的應用程式）的問題，例如消失或過時的應用程式，請使用[此問題追蹤系統](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request for Packaging"
msgstr "提案佇列表"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "To request a new application to be packaged (add an app to our app store), please, first check the app data issue tracker to see if that application was available in the past and got removed. Any remaining request for packaging (RFP) can be added to [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Tools"
msgstr "伺服器工具"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues on the server tools (building apps yourself or running your own repo), please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."
msgstr "至於伺服器工具（用以自行構建應用程式或建立您的軟體庫）的問題，請使用[此問題追蹤系統](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website"
msgstr "網站"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to this web site, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."
msgstr "有關此網站的問題，您可使用[此問題追蹤系統](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website Search"
msgstr "網站搜尋"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to https://search.f-droid.org or search results in this website, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)."
msgstr "至於 https://search.f-droid.org 或此網站中搜尋結果的問題，您可使用[此問題追蹤系統](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Fire Hose"
msgstr "眾裡尋它"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you have not found the right place, try searching through [all of the issues](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/)  tracked by the F-Droid project."
msgstr "若仍找不著方向，可嘗試尋遍 F-Droid 專案追蹤的[所有議題](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/)試試看。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repomaker"
msgstr "「Repomaker」"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "F-Droid.org is just a repo out of hundreds of repos created by individuals all around the globe. With the tools of F-Droid, everyone can create their own repo. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you are free to create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgstr "F-Droid.org 只是全球各地所建立之數以百計個軟體庫中的一個軟體庫。借助 F-Droid 的工具，每個人都可以建立自己的軟體庫。所以不論您是想要發表自己音樂作品的音樂家，還是一個想發佈測試版應用程式的開發者，都能自由地建立您自己的軟體庫與其他人分享，獨立於 F-Droid.org 之外。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "In the past, creating a repo has been difficult because you had to have knowledge on the command line, needed to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them served well inside the F-Droid app."
msgstr "在過去，建立一個軟體庫是很困難的，因為您必須熟悉文字界面的操作，更新套件的詳細資料還得手動編輯文字檔案，並且必須將螢幕快照放在一個特殊的目錄系統中，才能讓它們在 F-Droid 應用程式中使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This all got easier now: with Repomaker, you are able to create your own repo and do not need to have any special knowledge to do so.  Check out the [installation guide](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)  for information on how you can install Repomaker on your device."
msgstr "現在一切都變得更加容易：有了 Repomaker，您就可以建立自己的軟體庫，而且不需要任何專門的知識。查看[安裝指南](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)以了解如何在裝置上安裝 Repomaker。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Your repo can serve all types of media*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*您的軟體庫可提供各種類型的媒體檔案*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Editing your package store details never was easier*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*編輯套件的詳細資料從未如此簡單*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Creating a repo just takes you two clicks*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})<br/>\n"
"*點兩下就能建立一個軟體庫*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/add-storage.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/add-storage.png %})<br/>\n"
"*You have many possibilities where to upload your repo*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/add-storage.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/add-storage.png %})<br/>\n"
"*軟體庫上傳位置的多種選擇*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "Like any other project of F-Droid, Repomaker is free and open source software. You can find the source code and its license on [gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker)."
msgstr "就像其他 F-Droid 專案一樣，Repomaker 也是自由且開源的軟體。您可以在 [gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker) 上取得原始碼和授權條款。"
